"test":{"name":"script-new-functions","kind":"rules","opponent":"Human","rounds":"4","check":"scriptNewFunctions","question":"The scenario functions added for Act 1's playtest: Unit Killed's How (in action, starved); Unit Moved outside an area; Units At Most counting only units in sight; Building Damaged (half its health gone); Unload Proposed (a unit picked in its transport's panel); Unit Moved not counting boarding or riding; Bonus Stars (-1 and +2: one more star in the rating, a star taken from a perfect result); Reveal Area (the ground shown through the fog past the end of the turn, then hidden by name); Highlight UI (the hook told the panel's name); a trigger switched on after its click was made counts the click (the unit already selected); the dialogue box's Next while a later Dialogue of the same trigger is to come, Close at the last; the script holds an AI while its actions run; the camera on a unit that has died goes where it fell; Briefing: its marker shown under the briefing, its line not said, never fired in play; Unit Cut Off keeps its real reading while a move's preview is on the board.","rules":"standard"},
